TITLE  Simulacion Co60 dist d3cm - Detector Canberra 802-3x3 (fuente volumetrica)
       .
       >>>>>>>> Source definition.
SKPAR  2                              [Primary particles: 2=ph]
SPECTR 1173.22e3 0.49967              [Co-60: 1173.23 keV, Ig=99.85%]
SPECTR 1173.24e3 0.0                  [Hueco entre lineas]
SPECTR 1332.47e3 0.50033              [Co-60: 1332.48 keV, Ig=99.98%]
SPECTR 1332.49e3 -1                   [Cierre espectro]
SPOSIT 0.0 0.0 -3.160000              [Centro fuente activa (dentro del disco)]
SBOX   0.1500 0.1500 0.0240           [Caja muestreo - confinada a BODY 1]
SBODY  1                              [Confinar emision a fuente activa]
SCONE  0 0 180                        [Emision isotropa]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Material data and simulation parameters.
MFNAME cobalto.mat                      [Material 1: Fuente activa Co60]
MSIMPA 1e4 1e3 1e4 0.10 0.10 1e4 1e3
MSIMPH 1e4 1e4 1e4 0.05 0.05 1e4
MSIMPN 1.0 50
       .
MFNAME platico.mat                    [Material 2: Plastico (soporte disco)]
