       >>>>>>>> Geometry and local simulation parameters.
GEOMFN detector.geo                   [Geometry file]
DSMAX  1 0.002                        [Step limit en fuente activa (muy fina)]
DSMAX  2 0.05                         [Step limit en plastico]
DSMAX  5 0.1                          [Step limit en cristal]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Emerging particles. Energy and angular distributions.
NBE    0 1.4e6 1000                   [Energy window hasta 1400 keV y 1000 bins]
NBANGL 180 1                          [Angular bins]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Energy deposition detectors.
ENDETC 0 1.4e6 1000                   [Energy window hasta 1400 keV para NaI]
EDSPC  spc-NaI-enddet.dat             [Output spectrum file name]
EDBODY 5                              [Active body: NaI Crystal (ahora body 5)]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Job properties.
RESUME dump.dmp                       [Resume from this dump file]
DUMPTO dump.dmp                       [Generate this dump file]
DUMPP  60                             [Dumping period, in sec]
NSIMSH 1.0e8                          [Number of showers]
TIME   1.0e9                          [Time limit in seconds]
